  "description": "You evoke a fiery blade in your free hand for the duration. As a Magic action, you can make a melee spell attack with the blade. On a hit, the target takes Fire damage equal to 3d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. The blade sheds Bright Light in a 10-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.",
